Chapter: HalFlashDoubleSeal
  cites Foreword chapter Board

 Sealing a bank twice. The first seal consumed the handle, so the second
 is a use of a spent value: CDX2061.

 On real silicon a second lock re-runs the controller's lock sequence on
 a bank the driver no longer owns.

Section: Body
  double-seal : Integer -> [Flash, Device.Mmio] Integer
  double-seal (base) = act
    b0 <- flash-open-bank base
    r <- flash-seal-bank b0
    flash-seal-bank b0
  end

  opening : Text = "double"
